<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 95,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 95,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est 95,000, Wk ago 111,000, and Yr ago 98,000 head at interior Iowa/southern Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded mostly steady compared with mid-session Tuesday. Trade was slow for light to moderate demand and light offerings. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
